<title>SWEDEN: Assa Abloy posts 63 pct jump '96 profit.</title>
<headline>Assa Abloy posts 63 pct jump '96 profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish lock maker Assa Abloy on Friday reported its earnings for the 12 months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				345 vs    212</p>
<p> Sales					 5,007 vs  3,504</p>
<p> Earnings per share (SKR)		 3.98 vs   2.41</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns)	     1.25 vs   1.00</p>
<p> Operating costs			   4,282 vs 3,070</p>
<p> Depreciation				  265 vs   184</p>
<p> Net financial items			 123 vs    47</p>
<p> Associate interests			   8 vs    10</p>
<p> Tax						97 vs    68</p>
<p> Net profit				    248 vs   144</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
